 `skills/litestartup-publish/` |\n| *"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"*Admin** | Initialize, configure and deploy SaaS applications using litesaas-admin boilerplate | `sk"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ills/litestartup-admin/` |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"More skills coming soon: video-generator, deploy."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Option A: npx (recommended)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Option B: Manual"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Your Content Repo Structure"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"After binding and writing content, your repo will look like this:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Editor Support"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Editor | Adapter file | Copy to |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Codex | `adapters/codex/AGENTS.md` | `AGENTS.md` |\n| Claude Code | `adapters/claude/CLAUDE.md` | `"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"CLAUDE.md` |\n| Cursor | `adapters/cursor/litestartup.mdc` | `.cursor/rules/litestartup.mdc` |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Repo Structure"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- API keys NEVER appear in AI conversation or logs\n- Keys stored in `~/.litestartup/credentials`, re"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ad only by scripts\n- Scope-limited: `system.publish` (publish), `auth` (admin)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **Product page**: https://www.litestartup.com/products/litestartup-skills\n- **Documentation**: htt"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ps://www.litestartup.com/docs/en/features/litestartup-skills\n- **Demo content repo**: https://github"},{"id":"p27s3","text":".com/litestartup-com/litestartup-workspace"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
